      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もう一度、やるぞ！\r\n次こそわしが絶対に勝ーッつ！",
        "official_en": "We are to duel once again. Except this time, you shall know defeat!",
        "real_en": "Let's go again! I'll definitely win next time!"
