        "official_en_sha256": "c29a274a8cb08727537a20685683c3335611fee893567127883d3ac34b1d7dd3"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "わしが人間に力を貸すときがくるなんてのう……。\r\nまぁ、これも星の巡りか。",
        "official_en": "To think I would ever side with humans... It appears fate has its own strange designs.",
        "real_en": "To think I'd ever lend my power to humans... Well, perhaps it's how the stars have aligned."
      },
